OL,9,G0935 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,10,G     Sea
OL,11,     FIt's the final day of the cruise
OL,12,     Ffor the travellers. But before
OL,13,     Fheading home they explore the
OL,14,     Fholiday hotspot for the rich and
OL,15,     Ffamous: the Greek party capital of
OL,16,     FMykonos.
OL,17,G1035 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,18,G     Sea
OL,19,     FIt's day one and the cruise begins
OL,20,     Fwith a trip to the ancient Greek
OL,21,     Fcity of Athens, including a visit
OL,22,     Fto the ruins of Hadrian's Library.
